<title>UK: Rugby league-World Club championship results.</title>
<headline>Rugby league-World Club championship results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Collated results of World Club championship rugby league matches on Sunday:</p>
<p>Pool A</p>
<p> Canberra (Australia)	70 Halifax (England)		6</p>
<p> Warrington (England)	12 Cronulla (Australia)	  40</p>
<p>Pool B</p>
<p> Adelaide (Australia)	50 Salford (England)		8</p>
<p> Castleford (England)	16 Perth (Australia)	     24</p>
<p> Paris St Germain (France) 12 Hunter Mariners (Australia) 28</p>
</text>
